Scoped vibrance video filter

The option table (intensity, rbal, gbal, bbal, rlum, glum, blum, alternate:
AVOption order, ranges, defaults and the float storage of AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT),
pixel_fmts, the ff_fill_rgba_map byte offsets and the single-precision pixel
arithmetic of vibrance_slice8 and vibrance_slice8p (scale 1/255, FFMAX3/FFMIN3
saturation, the luma sum, the FFSIGN-signed per-channel factors, lerpf and the
av_clip_uint8 store of the truncated product) in src/video-ops/vibrance.ts
follow libavfilter/vf_vibrance.c (vibrance_options, pixel_fmts, config_input,
filter_frame, vibrance_slice8, vibrance_slice8p).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
